      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Vaga-Lume. Volbeat vive ao redor de lagoas limpas. À noite, sua parte traseira se ilumina. Ele pisca essa luz para se comunicar com outros Volbeat e adora o aroma doce liberado por Illumise.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 100% M / 0% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Volbeat não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Flash, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Double Team</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Struggle Bug</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Moonlight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Tail Glow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Signal Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Protect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Helping Hand</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Bug Buzz</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Double-Edge, Infestation, Play Rough</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Attract, Baton Pass, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bug Bite, Bug Buzz, Charge Beam, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Double Team, Double- Edge, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Drain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Infestation, Light Screen, Lunge, Metronome, Mud-Slap, Play Rough, Pounce, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest